
**Rebranding changes:**

**Server redirect:**
- `src/constants.ts` — set `defaultServerUrl` to `https://clickstream.acaiplatform.ai/api/collect` (just replace this one value)
- On SDK init, `_setDefaultServerUrl()` is automatically called to point all events to your server

**Before publishing**, you need to:
1. Replace `https://clickstream.acaiplatform.ai/api/collect` in `src/constants.ts` with your real server URL
2. Replace `YOUR_ORG` in `package.json` and `acai-react-native.podspec` with your GitHub org
3. Push to GitHub, then `npm publish` to make it available as `@acai/react-native-sdk`